{"locales":{"en":{"5j3dqdxv0zc":{"lh_a168_title":"Transform Your Water With Metpure Filters","title":"Our Sediment Filters","des_html":"Ensure clean and clear water with the Metpure Sediment Filter Collection. Our carefully curated collection of sediment filters is designed to effectively remove suspended particles, sediment, and impurities from your water supply.<!--lh-live-editor-->","btn":"Shop Collection"},"zwuashgf5r":{"lh_a168_title":"DISCOVER THE BENEFITS OF OUR SEDIMENT FILTER","lh_9wid92_lable":"Sediment Removal\u2028Targeting Impurities at the Source","lh_9wid92_desc_html":"The sediment filters utilize a highly efficient, multi-layered filtration system designed to capture and remove even the finest particles suspended in water. Employing a combination of mesh sizes, these filters effectively trap sedimentary impurities, preventing their passage through the filtration media.\u00a0<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_a5w0bb_lable":"Each Filter Entails Radial Multi-Gradient Structure Technology","lh_a5w0bb_desc_html":"Radial Multi-Gradient Structure Technology in sediment filters is an advanced design that optimizes particle removal efficiency. The filter features multiple layers with varying densities arranged in a radial pattern, creating a gradient effect. Larger particles are captured in the outer layers, while smaller ones are progressively filtered as water moves toward the center.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"lkz11fdk46":{"lh_sjlit0_soldout":"Sold out","lh_sjlit0_new":"New","wishlist":"Wishlist","lh_txhi7h_view":"Quick view","lh_f635tz_cart":"Add to cart","lh_3k9wqs_options":"Select options","lh_8hwm_now":"Add to cart","lh_hth6t_detail":"VIEW DETAIL","lh_hth6t_more":"VIEW MORE","lh_a168_title":"SHOP SEDIMENT FILTER COLLECTION"},"o5mwt1nlbf7":{"title":"Our Carbon Block Filters","des_html":"Discover the exceptional filtration capabilities of our CARBON Block Collection, featuring a range of premium water filters designed to elevate your water purification experience. Each filter in this collection is meticulously crafted to deliver superior performance, effectively reducing chlorine, taste, and odor while efficiently eliminating volatile organic carbon compounds, insecticides, pesticides, and solvents.<!--lh-live-editor-->","btn":"Shop Collection"},"8itsx5bog6r":{"lh_a168_title":"DISCOVER THE BENEFITS OF OUR CARBON BLOCK FILTER","lh_9wid92_lable_html":"Carbon Removal\u2028<br>Enhancing Water Clarity<div><\/div>","lh_9wid92_desc_html":"Carbon block filters employ a specialized porous structure composed of activated carbon to effectively remove impurities from water. As water passes through the dense carbon block, contaminants such as chlorine, sediment, and volatile organic compounds are adsorbed onto the carbon surface.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_a5w0bb_lable":"Each Filter Entails Radial Multi-Gradient Structure Technology","lh_a5w0bb_desc_html":"Radial Multi-Gradient Structure Technology in sediment filters is an advanced design that optimizes particle removal efficiency. The filter features multiple layers with varying densities arranged in a radial pattern, creating a gradient effect. Larger particles are captured in the outer layers, while smaller ones are progressively filtered as water moves toward the center.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"i618t9tlyxs":{"lh_a168_title_html":"<div class=\"centered\" style=\"font-size: 48px; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\">     <span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #3587CD;\">FILTERS WITH SUPERIOR&nbsp;<\/span>     <span style=\"font-weight: 190; color: #3587CD;\">QUALITY<\/span> <\/div>","lh_ezc4q5_name":"Thick Rubber O-ring","lh_ezc4q5_content_html":"The thick padded o-rings are manufacturered with food-grade material that is designed to provide tight, sealed connection with the system and prevent water from bypassing the filter.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezhhnw_name":"Radial Flow Filtration","lh_ezhhnw_content_html":"Metpure's radial flow filtration allows water to enter the cartridge through radius of the filter outside in. The outer mesh first removes and traps large sediment, and the inner 5 micron extruded carbon block removes chlorine, bad taste, and odor.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"7v8gjt9nbp":{"lh_sjlit0_soldout":"Sold out","lh_sjlit0_new":"New","wishlist":"Wishlist","lh_txhi7h_view":"Quick view","lh_f635tz_cart":"Add to cart","lh_3k9wqs_options":"Select options","lh_8hwm_now":"Add to cart","lh_hth6t_detail":"VIEW DETAIL","lh_hth6t_more":"VIEW MORE","lh_a168_title":"SHOP CARBON BLOCK FILTER COLLECTION"},"7rn1njd6sqj":{"title":"Granular Activated Carbon (GAC) Inline Filters","des_html":"Discover the power of Granular Activated Carbon (GAC) with our advanced water filtration solutions. Our GAC filters are designed to provide you with clean, refreshing water by effectively removing impurities, odors, and unwanted taste from your tap water.<!--lh-live-editor-->","btn":"Shop Collection"},"rrarsw18v5h":{"lh_a168_title_html":"DISCOVER THE BENEFITS OF OUR GAC INLINE&nbsp; FILTER","lh_9wid92_lable":"INLINE COCONUT SHELL GRANULAR ACTIVATED CARBON (GAC)","lh_9wid92_desc_html":"<!--lh-live-editor-->GAC filters employ a specialized porous structure composed of activated carbon to effectively remove impurities from water. As water passes through the dense carbon block, contaminants such as chlorine, sediment, and volatile organic compounds are adsorbed onto the carbon surface.","lh_a5w0bb_lable":"CRYSTAL-CLEAR CONFIDENCE BREATHE EASY WITH GAC QUICK CONNECT","lh_a5w0bb_desc_html":"<!--lh-live-editor-->Ditch the bulky, slow-flow filters. GAC QUICK CONNECT delivers crystal-clear water at blazing speed. Enjoy reduced contaminants, improved taste, and optimal hydration with this convenient, standard-size cartridge. Replace in minutes, refresh your health for months. GAC QUICK CONNECT \u2013 pure and simple water perfection."},"oqn5tskgx9":{"lh_sjlit0_soldout":"Sold out","lh_sjlit0_new":"New","wishlist":"Wishlist","lh_txhi7h_view":"Quick view","lh_f635tz_cart":"Ad